      "conversationId": "apollo_infernus_convo03",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_01.mp3",
          "text": "I've heard what you can do.",
          "duration": 1.402
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_02.mp3",
          "text": "Make the best sidecar in Manhattan?",
          "duration": 1.93
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_03.mp3",
          "text": "You know what I mean.  Why are you working as a bartender?",
          "duration": 3.976
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo03_04.mp3",
          "text": "You make enough bad choices in your life it feels real good when you start making the right ones.",
          "duration": 5.276
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "apollo_infernus_convo04",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_01.mp3",
          "text": "Sirosi galah, Infernus.",
          "duration": 2.261
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_02.mp3",
          "text": "You having a stroke, son?",
          "duration": 1.327
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_03.mp3",
          "text": "You don't know Ixian?",
          "duration": 1.282
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_04.mp3",
          "text": "English is the only language my parents will speak around me.",
          "duration": 2.454
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_05.mp3",
          "text": "So they just want to abandon our culture?",
          "duration": 2.103
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Infernus",
          "audioFile": "inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/inferno_match_start_fencer_inferno_convo04_06.mp3",
          "text": "You'd have to ask them.  All I know is that If my parents thought living in Ixia was so great they never would've left.",
          "duration": 6.12
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "apollo_mo&krill_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "So is the mole your servant?",
          "duration": 1.945
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "Of course not.  We are equals.",
          "duration": 2.533
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Apollo",
          "audioFile": "fencer_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/fencer_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "Then why doesn't he speak for himself.",
          "duration": 2.21
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Mo&krill",
          "audioFile": "krill_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/krill_match_start_fencer_krill_convo01_04.mp3",
